//     * ConstrainedStep returns EOS or a parser-valid extension. If EOS, we break
//       (invariant preserved). Otherwise AppendConstrainedToken preserves validity
//       because ConstrainedStep guarantees the returned token keeps currentConstrained
//       + [next] parser-valid. Invariant preserved.
//
