//   - Phase 3 inner loop: Each iteration increments steps by 1 (one constrained
//     step or one close step) and appends at most 1 token to generated. Since
//     the loop runs at most maxSteps - steps iterations total (bounded by the
//     `steps < maxSteps` guard), |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps is
//     maintained throughout.
